  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "At the Potter's House",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the word that came to Jeremiah from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Go down to the potter's house, and there I will give you my message.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went down to the potter's house, and I saw him working at the wheel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the pot he was shaping from the clay was marred in his hands; so the potter formed it into another pot, shaping it as seemed best to him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said, \"Can I not do with you, Israel, as this potter does?\" declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". \"Like clay in the hand of the potter, so are you in my hand, Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If at any time I announce that a nation or kingdom is to be uprooted, torn down and destroyed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and if that nation I warned repents of its evil, then I will relent and not inflict on it the disaster I had planned.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if at another time I announce that a nation or kingdom is to be built up and planted,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and if it does evil in my sight and does not obey me, then I will reconsider the good I had intended to do for it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Now therefore say to the people of Judah and those living in Jerusalem, 'This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: Look! I am preparing a disaster for you and devising a plan against you. So turn from your evil ways, each one of you, and reform your ways and your actions.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they will reply, 'It's no use. We will continue with our own plans; we will all follow the stubbornness of our evil hearts.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore this is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 18:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Inquire among the nations:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Who has ever heard anything like this?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 18:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A most horrible thing has been done",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "by Virgin Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Does the snow of Lebanon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ever vanish from its rocky slopes?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 18:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Do its cool waters from distant sources",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ever stop flowing?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet my people have forgotten me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "they burn incense to worthless idols,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 18:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "which made them stumble in their ways,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "in the ancient paths.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 18:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "They made them walk in byways,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "on roads not built up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their land will be an object of horror",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and of lasting scorn;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 18:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "all who pass by will be appalled",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and will shake their heads.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Like a wind from the east,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will scatter them before their enemies;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 18:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will show them my back and not my face",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "in the day of their disaster.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said, \"Come, let's make plans against Jeremiah; for the teaching of the law by the priest will not cease, nor will counsel from the wise, nor the word from the prophets. So come, let's attack him with our tongues and pay no attention to anything he says.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Listen to me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.18.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.18.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ";",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "hear what my accusers are saying!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Should good be repaid with evil?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 18:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yet they have dug a pit for me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 18:20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Remember that I stood before you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
